                  "pass": "build mode: the judge graded every acceptance check pass",
                  "incomplete": "a reviewer, refuter or judge failed or left a check ungraded; never a pass",
                  "oscillation": "review mode: a finding the fixer reported fixed came back in a later round",
                  "plateau": "build mode: plateau_rounds rounds in a row passed no more checks than the best round so far",
                  "cap": "the round cap (args.maxRounds) was reached with open items",
